OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with hill fog to
OL,6,Fstart, and often wet with rain
OL,7,Fheaviest in the east. Drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter in the far southwest of the
OL,9,Fcountry, these conditions becoming
OL,10,Fmore widespread through the afternoon.
OL,11,FFeeling chilly despite light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry, clear interlude in the
OL,14,Fevening before rain and cloud push
OL,15,Fback in overnight. Winds strengthening
OL,16,Fthrough the early hours from the
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
