OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWet and windy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of heavier rain through much
OL,7,Fof the day. Drier by evening away from
OL,8,Fsouthern coasts where showers may
OL,9,Fpersist. Strong winds reaching gale at
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FOccasionally sunny on Thursday.
OL,14,FTurning wet and windy overnight with
OL,15,Fcoastal gales likely. Another settled
OL,16,Fspell possible from late Friday,
OL,17,Fbefore further rain arrives later
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
